<title>HONG KONG: Fairwood interim net loss HK$26.93 mln.</title>
<headline>Fairwood interim net loss HK$26.93 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.7 loss   vs  0.4 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  7.05 gain  vs  4.96 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    26.93 loss vs  2.05 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     671.17     vs  700.97</p>
<p>    Company name		 Fairwood Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Fairwood is a fast food chain.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$12 million on disposal of property, a HK$1.59 million loss on cost for organisational restructuring and a HK$3.36 million loss on fixed assets written off on closure of restaurants.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
